    <ol class="steps">
      <li><span class="step-num">1</span><div><strong>We talk</strong><p>Tell me about your event, your date and what you love. Photos, colors, a place: anything helps. I read and answer every message myself.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="step-num">2</span><div><strong>A first sketch</strong><p>I paint a first sketch and send it to you.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="step-num">3</span><div><strong>We fine-tune</strong><p>Changes are included in the price. Your wording can be in English, Hebrew, or both.</p></div></li>
